{"v":1,"book":"2Chr","ch":16,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"In the thirty-sixth year of the reign of Asa, Baasha the king of Israel went up against Judah and built Ramah to prevent anyone from going out from or coming in to Asa the king of Judah.","tok":[{"t":"In the thirty-sixth "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"reign","s":["H4438"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Asa","s":["H0609"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Baasha","s":["H1201"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[8]},{"t":" went "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[5]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"built","s":["H1129"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ramah","s":["H7414"],"a":[13]},{"t":" to prevent anyone from going "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[16]},{"t":" from or coming "},{"t":"in","s":["H0935"],"a":[17]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Asa","s":["H0609"],"a":[18]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[19]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[20]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And Asa brought out silver and gold from the treasures of the house of Jehovah and the king’s house and sent them to Ben-hadad the king of Syria who was dwelling in Damascus, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Asa","s":["H0609"],"a":[1]},{"t":" brought "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"treasures","s":["H0214"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"king’s","s":["H4428"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[9]},{"t":" them to "},{"t":"Ben","s":["H1130"],"a":[11]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"hadad","s":["H1130"],"a":[11]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Syria","s":["H0758"],"a":[14]},{"t":" who was "},{"t":"dwelling","s":["H3427"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Damascus","s":["H1834"],"a":[16]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[17]},{"t":","}]},{"n":3,"text":"There is an alliance between me and you as there was between my father and your father. I am now sending you silver and gold; go, break your alliance with Baasha the king of Israel, so that he goes away from me.","tok":[{"t":"There is an alliance between me and you as there was between my "},{"t":"father","s":["H0001"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and your "},{"t":"father","s":["H0001"],"a":[6]},{"t":". I am now sending you "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"break","s":["H6565"],"a":[13]},{"t":" your alliance with "},{"t":"Baasha","s":["H1201"],"a":[16]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[18]},{"t":", so that he goes away from me."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And Ben-hadad listened to King Asa. And he sent the captains of his armies against the cities of Israel, and they struck Ijon and Dan and Abel-maim and all the store cities of Naphtali.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Ben","s":["H1130"],"a":[1]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"hadad","s":["H1130"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"listened","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"King","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Asa","s":["H0609"],"a":[5]},{"t":". And he "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"captains","s":["H8269"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"armies","s":["H2428"],"a":[9]},{"t":" against the "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[14]},{"t":", and they struck "},{"t":"Ijon","s":["H5859"],"a":[17]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Dan","s":["H1835"],"a":[19]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Abel","s":["H0066"],"a":[21]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"maim","s":["H0066"],"a":[21]},{"t":" and all the "},{"t":"store","s":["H4543"],"a":[25]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[26]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Naphtali","s":["H5321"],"a":[27]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And when Baasha heard this, he stopped building Ramah and ceased his work.","tok":[{"t":"And when "},{"t":"Baasha","s":["H1201"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[1]},{"t":" this, he stopped "},{"t":"building","s":["H1129"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ramah","s":["H7414"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"ceased","s":["H7673"],"a":[7]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"work","s":["H4399"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And Asa the king took all Judah, and they carried away the stones of Ramah and its timber, with which Baasha had built it, and built Geba and Mizpah with them.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Asa","s":["H0609"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"took","s":["H3947"],"a":[2]},{"t":" all "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and they carried "},{"t":"away","s":["H5375"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"stones","s":["H0068"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Ramah","s":["H7414"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and its "},{"t":"timber","s":["H6086"],"a":[11]},{"t":", with which "},{"t":"Baasha","s":["H1201"],"a":[14]},{"t":" had built it, and "},{"t":"built","s":["H1129"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Geba","s":["H1387"],"a":[18]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Mizpah","s":["H4709"],"a":[20]},{"t":" with them."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And at that time Hanani the seer came to Asa the king of Judah and said to him, Because you have trusted in the king of Syria and have not trusted in Jehovah your God, therefore the army of the king of Syria has escaped out of your hand.","tok":[{"t":"And at that "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Hanani","s":["H2607"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"seer","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Asa","s":["H0609"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to him, Because you have trusted in the